   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Lui and leur",
     "texto": [
      "With verbs that take **à + person**, replace that person with **lui** (to him or her) or **leur** (to them): **Je parle à Paul** → **Je lui parle**.",
      "Not all verbs with **à** use **lui/leur**: **Je pense à Paul** → **Je pense à lui**. Learn the pronoun together with the verb."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Where it goes",
     "texto": [
      "Like direct object pronouns, **lui** and **leur** go **before the verb**: **Je lui parle**, **Tu leur parles**.",
      "If there is an infinitive, they go before it: **Je vais lui écrire** (I'm going to write to him/her)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
